have enabled so far in terms of AI is really the code generation using Positron within POSIT.

00:18:13.839 --> 00:18:20.239
Which works closely with Cloud and uses MCP so that it can connect to our governed data.

00:18:20.880 --> 00:18:24.800
So that's what it does. And in the future, probably we'll be using other features of AI as

