because we have governed data in one place. We have all these different platforms working

00:18:49.119 --> 00:18:55.119
closely with one another. And we have version control in place. And we also have AI and agents

00:18:55.119 --> 00:19:02.880
working for us. All this aids and brings together rapid decision making, which is accurate. And then

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:10.400
leverages and makes sure that there is a human being sitting on top of whatever AI tells us,

